use firn/tags

protonvpn-cli is a Module
protonvpn-cli is tagged vpn

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.protonvpn-cli.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.protonvpn-cli]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."protonvpn-cli"."enable": enable "ProtonVPN CLI client"
